OL,3,GNEWSAPolice say Nottingham attacks were
OL,4,A'not preventable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has said the Nottingham
OL,7,Fattacks were not "reasonably
OL,8,Fforeseeable or preventable", a public
OL,9,Finquiry has heard.
OL,11,FValdo Calocane - who was diagnosed with
OL,12,Fparanoid schizophrenia in 2020 -
OL,13,Fstabbed to death Barnaby Webber, Grace
OL,14,FO'Malley-Kumar and Ian Coates, and
OL,15,Ftried to kill three others in a spate
OL,16,Fof attacks on 13 June 2023.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
