OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice say Nottingham attacks were
OL,4,A'not preventable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottinghamshire Police dealt with
OL,7,FCalocane on 10 or 11 occasions between
OL,8,F2020 and 2022, but John Beggs KC -
OL,9,Frepresenting the force - said police
OL,10,F"cannot manage dangerous paranoid
OL,11,Fschizophrenics".
OL,13,FAt the Nottingham Inquiry - which has
OL,14,Fbeen examining the attacks - Beggs
OL,15,Fchallenged the idea that any police
OL,16,Fmistakes before the killings were
OL,17,Fmissed opportunities.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
